    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d601">

                <pb facs="0655" n="551" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg551"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 868.001 G 29/2.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Minister to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Athens</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-03-18">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 18, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Reports that King George was shot and killed this afternoon at Saloniki. While
                    walking with an aide de camp a Greek socialist shot him through the heart from
                    behind a wall. The Queen will return to Saloniki tonight from Athens where she
                    just arrived.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Schurman</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
